tyle=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolDefinition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'function'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  function: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'search_knowledge_base'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'在知识库中搜索与查询相关的文档。当用户提问涉及特定领域知识时使用此工具。'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    parameters: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'object'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      properties: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        query: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'string'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'搜索查询文本'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        top_k: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'number'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'返回结果数量，默认为 5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        filters: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'object'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"过滤条件，如 {category: 'tech', date_from: '2024-01-01'}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      required: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'query'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 工具的 <code>description</code> 字段是影响 LLM 选择正确工具的最重要因素。描述应该说明「什么时候用」而不仅仅是「做什么」。例如，「当用户需要查询实时天气信息时使用此工具」优于「获取天气数据」。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"并行函数调用\">并行函数调用</h2><p>现代 LLM 支持在一次响应中同时发起多个工具调用，大幅提升执行效率。当多个工具调用之间没有依赖关系时，应该鼓励并行调用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    U[&quot;用户: 查询北京和上海的天气&quot;] --&gt; LLM[&quot;LLM 分析&quot;]&#10;    LLM --&gt; TC1[&quot;Tool Call 1&lt;br/&gt;get_weather(北京)&quot;]&#10;    LLM --&gt; TC2[&quot;Tool Call 2&lt;br/&gt;get_weather(上海)&quot;]&#10;    TC1 --&gt; R1[&quot;结果: 晴 25°C&quot;]&#10;    TC2 --&gt; R2[&quot;结果: 多云 22°C&quot;]&#10;    R1 --&gt; LLM2[&quot;LLM 汇总&quot;]&#10;    R2 --&gt; LLM2&#10;    LLM2 --&gt; A[&quot;北京晴天 25°C,上海多云 22°C&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    U[\"用户: 查询北京和上海的天气\"] --&gt; LLM[\"LLM 分析\"]\n    LLM --&gt; TC1[\"Tool Call 1&lt;br/&gt;get_weather(北京)\"]\n    LLM --&gt; TC2[\"Tool Call 2&lt;br/&gt;get_weather(上海)\"]\n    TC1 --&gt; R1[\"结果: 晴 25°C\"]\n    TC2 --&gt; R2[\"结果: 多云 22°C\"]\n    R1 --&gt; LLM2[\"LLM 汇总\"]\n    R2 --&gt; LLM2\n    LLM2 --&gt; A[\"北京晴天 25°C,上海多云 22°C\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import json&#10;from openai import OpenAI&#10;&#10;client = OpenAI()&#10;&#10;def dispatch_tool(name: str, args: dict) -&gt; dict:&#10;    tool_registry = {&#10;        &quot;get_weather&quot;: get_weather,&#10;        &quot;search_knowledge_base&quot;: search_knowledge_base,&#10;        &quot;run_code&quot;: run_code&#10;    }&#10;    if name not in tool_registry:&#10;        return {&quot;error&quot;: f&quot;未知工具: {name}&quot;}&#10;    return tool_registry[name](**args)&#10;&#10;def agent_with_tools(user_message: str, tools: list) -&gt; str:&#10;    input_items = [{&quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: user_message}]&#10;&#10;    while True:&#10;        response = client.responses.create(&#10;            model=&quot;gpt-5.6-terra&quot;,&#10;            input=input_items,&#10;            tools=tools,&#10;            parallel_tool_calls=True&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        # 把模型输出（含文本与 function_call 项）并入对话上下文&#10;        input_items += response.output&#10;&#10;        function_calls = [i for i in response.output if i.type == &quot;function_call&quot;]&#10;        if not function_calls:&#10;            return response.output_text&#10;&#10;        for call in function_calls:&#10;            result = dispatch_tool(call.name, json.loads(call.arguments))&#10;            input_items.append({&#10;                &quot;type&quot;: &quot;function_call_output&quot;,&#10;                &quot;call_id&quot;: call.call_id,&#10;                &quot;output&quot;: json.dumps(result, ensure_ascii=False)&#10;            })\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> openai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OpenAI()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dispatch_tool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, args: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tool_registry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"get_weather\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: get_weather,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"search_knowledge_base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: search_knowledge_base,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"run_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: run_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tool_registry:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shi