nknown&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pydantic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BaseModel, Field</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WeatherParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BaseModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    city: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Field(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"城市名称\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    unit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Field(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"celsius\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"温度单位\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> safe_parse_tool_call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(arguments: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, schema: type[BaseModel]) -> BaseModel:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> schema.model_validate_json(arguments)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Exception</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> schema(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">city</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"unknown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>函数调用是 LLM 从纯文本生成跨越到工具使用的关键能力，是 Agent 与外部世界交互的桥梁。</li>\n<li>OpenAI 的 Responses API 是当前推荐的 Agent API 入口；Chat Completions 仍可用，工具定义思路相通。</li>\n<li>工具定义的 description 字段是决定 LLM 正确选择工具的最重要因素。</li>\n<li>并行函数调用支持同时执行多个无依赖的工具调用，大幅提升效率。</li>\n<li>参数幻觉、工具混淆、无限循环是函数调用中最常见的陷阱，需要通过 Schema 约束和调用限制来防范。</li>\n<li>使用 Pydantic 等工具进行参数校验可以有效提升函数调用的健壮性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"函数调用","id":"函数调用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从文本生成到工具使用","id":"从文本生成到工具使用"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenAI Function Calling 机制","id":"openai-function-calling-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"工具定义与参数 Schema","id":"工具定义与参数-schema"},{"level":2,"text":"并行函数调用","id":"并行函数调用"},{"level":2,"text":"函数调用的常见陷阱","id":"函数调用的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"记忆系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/foundations/memory-systems"},"next":{"title":"工具设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/tool-use/tool-design-patterns"}}